subckt transconductance (VIN VOUT VDD VSS)
parameters gm=1m
GCORE (0 VOUT VIN 0) vccs gm=gm
ends transconductance

subckt voltage_amplifier (VIN VOUT VDD VSS)
parameters gain=1
ECORE (VOUT 0 VIN 0) vcvs gain=gain
ends voltage_amplifier

subckt dut (VSS Vout Vin2 Vin1)
C1 (Vout net2) capacitor c=1p
C2 (net1 VSS) capacitor c=1p
C3 (Vout net3) capacitor c=1p
C5 (net5 VSS) capacitor c=1p
CB (net0 VSS) capacitor c=1p
CL (Vout VSS) capacitor c=1p
Cx (net4 VSS) capacitor c=1p
R1 (net0 VSS) resistor r=1k
R2 (net1 VSS) resistor r=1k
R3 (net4 VSS) resistor r=1k
R4 (net5 VSS) resistor r=1k
Rout (Vout VSS) resistor r=1k
X1 (Vin2 net0 0 VSS) transconductance gm=1m
X2 (Vin1 net1 0 VSS) transconductance gm=1m
X3 (net0 net2 0 VSS) transconductance gm=1m
X4 (net1 net3 0 VSS) transconductance gm=1m
X5 (net4 Vout 0 VSS) transconductance gm=1m
X6 (net5 Vout 0 VSS) transconductance gm=1m
X7 (net2 net4 0 VSS) voltage_amplifier gain=1
X8 (net3 net5 0 VSS) voltage_amplifier gain=1
